["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"ess","stream_identity":"01a0d3e0-4003-757b-b72c-9441fdf06fca","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIGebf79ca469a502ded4cc35f232d2b1407ae54c6c794744f3aca936e7dfb1d5ec","locator":"ep://planning/store/decision-blocker/decimal-canonical-serialization-crosses-repositories","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":1,"type":"aep.decision-blocker/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"## What is blocked\n\nThe `Decimal` half of `story:primitive-canonical-serialization`. The `Integer` half landed in wave\n22 as a guard (`crates/specify/ess-primitives/tests/canonical_number_serialization.rs`, 3 cases);\nthe `Decimal` half cannot follow without a decision this repository does not own alone.\n\n## What was measured, in wave 22\n\nTwo outcomes, both run rather than argued, by `aep-drive:implementor` in `wt-07c719139ac2`:\n\n| step | result |\n|---|---|\n| writer alone — exact decimal string, read door unmoved | wrong: 2/2 decimal acceptance cases still red, plus a new regression `adversary_round_trip_law_pass2` → `Error(\"invalid type: string \\\"1.0000000000000000001\\\", expected a finite number\")` |\n| both doors moved together | acceptance 5/5 green, and **two committed vectors break** |\n\nThe two that break:\n\n```\nevery_number_vector_keeps_its_exact_value_its_spelling_and_its_bytes\n  a-decimal-with-more-places-than-binary64-carries: Display\n  left: \"0.1000000000000000000001\"   right: \"0.1\"\n\nevery_ordering_vector_compares_exactly_and_facts_agree_with_numbers\n  a decimal the write would collapse is the value the write gives back\n  left: Less   right: Equal\n```\n\n`crates/specify/ess-primitives/tests/vectors/primitive-semantics.json:14` pins\n`\"display\": \"0.1\", \"json\": \"0.1\"` for the authored `0.1000000000000000000001`.\n\n## Why a green gate is not evidence here\n\nWith both doors moved, `ess-gen`, `ess-synth` and `ess-conformance` are **all green** — no fixture\nin them carries such a decimal. The change is nonetheless a contract break: a `Decimal` becomes a\nJSON **string** where `Number::json_schema` publishes `InstanceType::Number`, and\n`docs/design/review-conformance-coverage.md:172-176` says \"do not coerce to integer or string\".\nThe repository's own gate cannot see it.\n\n## What would settle it\n\nPer `AGENTS.md` and `docs/design/review-primitive-semantics.md:302-324`:\n\n- `ess-conformance/6` and `ess-conformance-report/2`;\n- the Atlas ADR;\n- AEP's `aep-ess-evidence::adapt_json` accepting the new spelling **before** any ESS writer emits it\n  by default — a reader in another repository.\n\n`obligation:review-contract-rollout-coordination` is still `open` and is the coordination this\nneeds.\n\n## Where the unlanded work is\n\nMeasured and deliberately not applied:\n\n- `/var/tmp/ess-wave-22/scratch/unit3/decimal-half-implementation.patch` — 17+/6- in `facts.rs`\n- `/var/tmp/ess-wave-22/scratch/unit3/decimal-half-cases.rs` — the two decimal acceptance cases\n\nBoth carry the measurement in their own text. They are scratch, not a branch: nothing preserves\nthem past this wave's cleanup unless somebody moves them.\n\n## One correction to the story's own scope\n\n`crates/verify/ess-conformance/src/report.rs` is listed in the story's `## Scope` as \"cited by stage\none\". It **is** a number writer (`quote` → `serde_json::to_string(&Node)`, `report.rs:424`), but\n`story:review-primitive-semantics`'s scope list does not contain it, so the attribution is wrong\neven though the path is right. Recorded rather than edited.\n","relations":[{"blocks":"story:primitive-canonical-serialization"}],"status":"open","title":"The Decimal half of canonical number serialization moves persisted bytes and needs a reader in another repository"},"lifecycle_state":"open"}},"id":"MIGebf79ca469a502ded4cc35f232d2b1407ae54c6c794744f3aca936e7dfb1d5ec","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":1,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIGebf79ca469a502ded4cc35f232d2b1407ae54c6c794744f3aca936e7dfb1d5ec"]}]